Package: iskra-delta-partner
Version: @VERSION@
Section: otherosfs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Iskra Delta Emulator Project
Depends: libc6, libgl1, libglx0, libglvnd0, libdrm2, libgbm1, libexpat1, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Chip-level Iskra Delta Partner emulator
 Native GUI and invisible MCP emulators with original Partner ROM images and
 model-specific system hard disks. Both Partner profiles include an internal
 Retro Vault Squid service and boot media containing PAKET.COM.
